					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230220503,
					"content": "相信我，这些材料比你之前选的那些都好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230220504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绮珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 230220504,
					"content": "那这次，你要帮我准备好救生用具。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230220505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
